cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the packaged data, please cite this repository
  (DOI archived on Zenodo) as well as the related review paper.
title: WJR_Comparison
authors:
  - name: WCHAO
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/WChao1988/WJR_Comparison"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23340061"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for comparing seafloor topography inversion from
  satellite-derived gravity fields. Implements and benchmarks six inversion
  approaches (GGM, EGGM, SAS, VParker, and the neural-network variants PDNN
  and Sandwell DNN) over three study regions in the Pacific Ocean using
  SWOT-derived gravity grids, ship soundings, and GEBCO reference bathymetry.
keywords:
  - seafloor topography
  - bathymetry
  - gravity inversion
  - satellite altimetry
  - SWOT
  - GEBCO
  - marine gravity
license: MIT
